    <string name="about_email_action">Send an e-mail</string>
    <string name="about_website_action">Open the website</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_heading">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">If you turn it on in Settings, Navia sends crash reports to Firebase Crashlytics, a Google service, so problems can be found and fixed; it is off by default. It uses your device location to tell you what is around you; your location is used on the device and is not sent to the app\'s developer. When you search for an address, that search text is sent to your device\'s geocoding service to be looked up.</string>
